SUMMARY:Quitting Party: A Brunch Salon on 'Letting Go'
DESCRIPTION:Olio Salons are by members for members. Generated by a passion 
 from someone in our community these are social events that create discussi
 on and learning about a new topic each time. To attend this salon you can 
 sign up for our monthly membership which gives you two\, $35 credits to us
 e towards Olio events each month. &nbsp\;We so often make space to celebra
 te when someone lands a new job\, gets engaged\, or buys a home but rarely
  do we take the time to acknowledge the courage it takes to move on from w
 hatever is no longer serving us (whether that is a job or a project\, a fr
 iendship or a partnership\, an idea or a goal\, a city or a home\, etc.). 
 This gathering aims to fix that: we're going to finally celebrate letting 
 go! This party will be facilitated by Olio member Jen Dyck-Sprout\, allowi
 ng guests the space and opportunity to:1. connect with others who have rec
 ent or upcoming transitions2. honour and grieve what has been/will be left
  behind3. celebrate the courage it takes to vote for oneself**WHAT TO EXPE
 CT**12:45 | DOORS OPEN: Grab some food\, a drink and settle in. We'll have
  a fun spread of tasty treats (vegan options) and celebratory beverages (a
 lcoholic\, and non-alcoholic)1:00 | WELCOME &amp\; INTRODUCTIONS1:30 | SMA
 LL GROUP DISCUSSIONS &amp\; ACTIVITIES2:30 | LARGE GROUP CELEBRATION &amp\
 ; MINGLEWant to be the next member to lead a salon night? Send us a note!&
 nbsp\;Hi@olio.rsvp&nbsp\;\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/
 quitting_party_a_bru
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/quitting_party_a_bru
END:VEVENT
