SUMMARY:Family Constellations: Subconscious Patterns in our Everyday Relati
 onships
DESCRIPTION:Family Constellations is a therapeutic approach and practice th
 at recognizes how our family's emotional history lives within us\, often u
 nconsciously shaping our experiences\, behaviors\, and struggles. Develope
 d by Psychotherapist\, Bert Hellinger\, this method acknowledges that heal
 ing often needs to happen at both an individual and systemic level.While t
 raditional talk therapy primarily focuses on individual healing\, Family C
 onstellations expands our perspective to include the entire family system.
 &nbsp\;When we think of the Soul a lot comes to mind — and most of it is
  often confusing because the one fact everyone agrees on is that it is som
 ething we cannot see nor fully grasp. What is the Soul? Does it even exist
 ? How can we understand it?Mystics like Theresa of Avila\, scholars\, arti
 sts\, philosophers\, scientists\, and even different religions have long t
 ried to make sense of the Soul\, find ways to capture it\, and/or question
  its existence.In this Olio we'll explore the Soul through the lens of Fam
 ily Constellations: an interior landscape where much of our past and that 
 of our ancestors is stored. We look at the Soul as a map that helps us nav
 igate through ancestral entanglements and blocked movements within us whic
 h don’t allow us to move forward in our everyday lives.&nbsp\;Listening 
 to\, uncovering\, and learning from these Soul movements form the core pra
 ctice of Family &amp\; Systemic Constellation work.Through interactive lec
 ture and a brief guided meditation\, we will get invited to explore our ow
 n Soul movements to help us better understand ourselves\, our loved ones\,
  our family\, and the people around us.*Though we are learning about the i
 deas of Family Constellations at this Olio\, we won't be setting up conste
 llations or working through anyone's personal family history\, and no prio
 r experience is needed.Our teacher for the evening: Luisa Muhr is a New Yo
 rk–based interdisciplinary artist and Family &amp\; Systemic Constellati
 ons practitioner\, originally from Vienna\, Austria\, with Hungarian and A
 natolian-Greek roots. She considers herself a “Field Worker” and was i
 ntroduced to Family Constellations in early childhood. Muhr later studied 
 with her mentor Dr. Peter Orban\, who grew out of the early Constellation 
 work in Germany. Alongside her healing arts practice\, Muhr is an experime
 ntal vocalist and interdisciplinary artist whose work spans voice\, sound\
 , movement\, improvisation\, installation\, performance art\, and experime
 ntal music theater. The evening flow: 7:00pm- Doors open\, grab a drink an
 d get settled&nbsp\;7:30pm - Olio Begins!8:30 - 8:45pm - Audience Q&amp\;A
 &nbsp\;9:00-10:00pm - Mingling at the Lighthouse&nbsp\;What Is an Olio?Thi
 nk Olio is an ongoing experiment in lifelong learning. We are a community 
 of open-minded people who gather to exchange ideas with new friends and co
 nnect over art\, literature\, and philosophy.Check out our full calendarOu
 r $30 membership gives you two events for the price of one!&nbsp\;An Olio 
 is what we call the social learning events we’ve been organizing since 2
 015. A blend between a lecture and a house party\, Olios are led by a teac
 her who loves sharing their passions and the room is filled with curious\,
  open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Our goal is to spark new perspectives\, ig
 nite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially offering an alternative to t
 ypical nightlife options.Disclaimer: By purchasing a ticket\, you agree to
  have your photo/video used for social media/marketing materials. If you p
 refer to not have your photo taken\, feel free to send us a note.Photo by 
 Zhi-Da Zhong\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/family_conste
 llations
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/family_constellations
END:VEVENT
