SUMMARY:Olio Sound Salon: Bad Bunny - DeBÍ TiRAR MáS FOToS
DESCRIPTION:Introducing the Olio Sound Salon!&nbsp\;The premise is simple:O
 ne album.&nbsp\;On vinyl.&nbsp\;Start to finish.&nbsp\;No skips.&nbsp\;As 
 the artist intended.&nbsp\;You and your peoples + new friends&nbsp\;Chat. 
 Dance. Sing.Run of showWe'll start the evening with some question prompts 
 over drinks at the bar and get settled into the room. Rob will give a brie
 f intro to the record and share some miscellaneous records that connect to
  or inspired Bad Bunny's Debí Tirar Más Fotos. We'll spin the album in i
 ts entirety while leaving room for questions and conversation throughout. 
 One room will be dedicated to listening and the other to dancing and chatt
 ing. *We'll have a salsa teacher to run through the basic steps and get ou
 r dance party going* After the album\, you'll get a list of tracks and alb
 ums that relate to Debí Tirar Más Fotos\, so you'll have anti-algorithm 
 sources straight from a DJ to keep your musical deep dive going after the 
 event.About Rob\, our DJ and Facilitator for the evening:Robert Michelin i
 s a native Brooklynite\, educator\, percussionist\, ethnomusicologist\, av
 id record collector\, and father.He earned his MMus in Ethnomusicology at 
 the University of London and his MS in Education at Brooklyn College\, and
  began his post-secondary studies as an Eph at Williams College.As a perfo
 rming artist\, he has shared the stage with Bernard Woma\, Obo Addy\, KweY
 ao Agyapon\, Paul Winter\, the Mujuru brothers\, Sekou Sundiata\, David Pl
 easant\, Abby Dobson\, Tito Fuentes\, and Crispin Robinson\, to name a few
 . His artistic mission is to help us understand that we have more in commo
 n than we have differences.What Is an Olio?Think Olio is an ongoing experi
 ment in lifelong learning. We are a community of open-minded people who ga
 ther to exchange ideas with new friends and connect over art\, literature\
 , and philosophy.Check out our full calendarOur $30 membership gives you t
 wo events for the price of one!&nbsp\;An Olio is what we call the social l
 earning events we’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend between a lectu
 re and a house party\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their 
 passions and the room is filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nb
 sp\;Our goal is to spark new perspectives\, ignite curiosity\, and enjoy o
 urselves socially—an alternative to typical nightlife options.Disclaimer
 : By purchasing a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for soc
 ial media/marketing materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\
 , feel free to send us a note. Photo by Zhi-Da Zhong\n\nTickets & info: ht
 tps://www.viewcy.com/event/olio_sound_salon_deb
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/olio_sound_salon_deb
